        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pipeline, natural gas, low pressure distribution network</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pipeline, natural gas, low pressure distribution network
Pipeline infrastructure for gas distribution. Life time 40 years. Annual transport of 30 TJ/km/a.;
UUID: dc9a8ea6-f255-3706-839a-400ac8477b96
This dataset describes the infrastructure needed for the Swiss low (&lt;0.1 bar) pressure distribution network.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The length of the pipelines is based on statistics, whereas the thickness of the pipeline is estimated.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 9500km
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dc9a8ea6-f255-3706-839a-400ac8477b96.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
